{"name":"Hidden Diary","hex":"#ede4cc","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"hidden","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["past participle of hide"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Located or positioned out of sight; not visually apparent.","Obscure. (Can we add an example for this sense?)"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/hidden"},{"term":"diary","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A daily log of experiences, especially those of the writer.","A personal organizer or appointment diary."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To keep a diary or journal."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/diary"}],"entries":[{"title":"Hidden Diary","blocks":[{"text":"Hidden Diary is a 2009 Franco-Canadian drama film directed by Julie Lopes-Curval. The film tells the story of three generations of women, starring Catherine Deneuve, Marina Hands and Marie-Josée Croze."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b4/M%C3%A8res_et_filles_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hidden_Diary","wikidata":"Q3332088"},{"title":"Diary","blocks":[{"text":"A diary is a written or audiovisual memorable record, with discrete entries arranged by date reporting on what has happened over the course of a day or other period. Diaries have traditionally been handwritten but are now also often digital. A personal diary may include a person's experiences, thoughts, and/or feelings, excluding comments on current events outside the writer's direct experience. Someone who keeps a diary is known as a diarist. Diaries undertaken for institutional purposes play a role in many aspects of human civilization, including government records, business ledgers, and military records. In British English, the word may also denote a preprinted journal format."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/The_Diary_of_a_Young_Girl_at_the_Anne_Frank_Zentrum.jpg/330px-The_Diary_of_a_Young_Girl_at_the_Anne_Frank_Zentrum.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diary","wikidata":"Q185598"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Pocket_diary_1860.jpg/500px-Pocket_diary_1860.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Pocket_diary_1860.jpg/1280px-Pocket_diary_1860.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Pocket_diary_1860.jpg/500px-Pocket_diary_1860.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Pocket diary 1860 with ruler for scale","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APocket_diary_1860.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Samuel_Pepys.jpg/500px-Samuel_Pepys.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Samuel_Pepys.jpg/1280px-Samuel_Pepys.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/21/Samuel_Pepys.jpg/500px-Samuel_Pepys.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Samuel Pepys","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASamuel_Pepys.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Maria_Faustyna_Kowalska.jpg/500px-Maria_Faustyna_Kowalska.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Maria_Faustyna_Kowalska.jpg/500px-Maria_Faustyna_Kowalska.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Faustina Kowalska","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMaria_Faus